License: LicenseRef-ECCC-Data-Server-End-Use
Comment:
 Recorded from api.weather.gc.ca under the Environment and Climate Change
 Canada Data Server End-use Licence. The attribution that licence requires is
 returned verbatim by EcccAlertProvider::attribution().

Files: libclimat/providers/fixture/data/seattle/alerts.json
